Package: space.havrysh.expectfix
Name: Kindle Whispersync Fix
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Strips the empty "Expect" HTTP header that old CFNetwork on iOS 6 attaches to Amazon Kindle app requests, which modern Amazon servers reject with 417 Expectation Failed. Fixes Whispersync (Sync to Furthest Page) on the Kindle app.
Maintainer: Havrysh project
Author: Havrysh project
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate
